            "review_title": "Review at The PUB",
            "review_text": "Samnmark\nCrawley, west sussex52 contributions\n0\nFriendly, Down to Earth and Great Service!\nFeb 2024 • Couples\nThe Pub\nOur first evening in Saigon and not yet au fait with the bar scene, we walked into somewhere… the honky tonk piano stopped and everyone stared. We walked out again and I’m so glad we did as we then stepped into this place. \n\nFriendly, welcoming and no catch. No service charge. No hidden extras. \n\nThe staff were amazing and friendly. We stopped in most nights for happy hour (2pm to 9pm) and welcomed with open arms and by name each time. \n\nComfortable, clean and welcoming. Should maybe change their name to Cheers. \n\nIf you want an honest drink… here is the place to be\nRead more\nWritten February 29, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
