            "review_text": "shinraemonsam\nSydney, Australia909 contributions\n2\nLast drink (and sandwich) of the night\nNov 2017 • Solo\nOpen at 2am. I was wasted. There was an even more sloshed Brit. A dozen girls to talk to and play pool with. \n\nYou get the idea. Nothing more, nothing less.\n\nGood girls put old mate in an Uber though. He couldn't work it out himself. Could barely stand up. They made him a sandwich. In another bar he might not have made it home so easily. Didn't seem to deserve to. So you gotta give it up for the ladies. LADIES! MAKE SOME NOISE!\nRead more\nWritten November 28, 2017",
