            "review_text": "BCG\nGreater Melbourne, Australia47 contributions\n0\nFriendly Siagon bar\nJul 2017 • Solo\nThere are a ton of bars in this area of HCM but this is one of the better one. Super friendly staff (most of the bars have friendly staff though).\nWhat sets this one apart is its a little bigger so when it gets a bit crowded you still can move around. It also has its own kitchen - the prawn spring rolls are great.\nThere is live music on Friday and Saturday nights which again is a nice variation.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten August 10, 2017",
