            "review_title": "Review at The PUB",
            "review_text": "Jeppe S\nKolding, Denmark16 contributions\n0\nDecent Bar\nJul 2017 • Business\nThis bar is very average. It is located on a strip where other, presumably average, bars are as well and not exactly in an area with a booming nightlife. It appeared that quite a few foreigners attend this bar in hopes of drawing attention from the staff- kind of a strange vibe. The bar, however, did have live music and the band played a variety of songs. Drinks were not too pricey- cannot comment on the food. \n\nIf I returned it would be for the live music, not so much the atmosphere. If you are looking for a quick drink the place will suffice.\nRead more\nWritten July 23, 2017",
